Two TODO comments in `day.spec.ts` called for tests verifying that meal deletion sets `isDirty = true` and enables the Save button. This PR replaces those TODOs with actual test cases.

## Changes

- **`save button > for an existing meal plan > is enabled if a meal is deleted`** — emits `delete` from `breakfast-view`, confirms via `ConfirmDialog`, asserts save button is no longer disabled.
- **`save button > for a new meal plan > is enabled if a meal is deleted`** — adds a breakfast first (no pre-existing meals in this context), then emits `delete`, confirms, and asserts save button remains enabled, validating that `doDelete()` unconditionally sets `isDirty = true`.

```ts
