The `@delete` event handlers in `day.vue` duplicated the same two-statement inline logic across all four meal views (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, Snack), making the template harder to maintain.

## Changes

- **`src/pages/planning/day.vue`**: Extracted repeated inline handler into a dedicated `openDeleteDialog(mealType: MealType)` function; all four `MealView` components now bind to it

```diff
- @delete="
-   showConfirmDialog = true;
-   mealToDelete = 'Breakfast';
- "
+ @delete="openDeleteDialog('Breakfast')"
```

```ts
const openDeleteDialog = (mealType: MealType) => {
  showConfirmDialog.value = true;
  mealToDelete.value = mealType;
};
```

