Addresses all outstanding issues flagged in review thread `3829853722` across four files.

## Changes

- **`cta-card.stories.tsx`** — Renamed all 4 occurrences of `ctacolorPalette` → `ctaColorPalette` (camelCase)
- **`avatar.tsx`** — Fixed incorrect `AvatarBadge` alias (`AvatarRoot` → `ChakraAvatar.Indicator`) and added `@deprecated` JSDoc pointing to `Avatar.Indicator`
- **`accordion-button.mdx`** — Added missing space after comma in import statement; removed stray blank line inside JSX code block
- **`layout.tsx`** — Collapsed duplicate `userInfo.roles` guard into a single block that calls both `setCurrentUserRole` and sets `newUserProps.user_role`

```tsx
// Before
export { AvatarRoot as AvatarBadge } from '@chakra-ui/react' // mapping wrong

// After
/** @deprecated Use `Avatar.Indicator` from Chakra UI v3 instead. */
export const AvatarBadge = ChakraAvatar.Indicator
```

```tsx
// Before — two separate guards, first one redundant
if (userInfo.roles && userInfo.roles.length > 0) {
  setCurrentUserRole(userInfo.roles[0].authority)
}
const newUserProps: GA4CustomUserProps = {}
if (userInfo.roles && userInfo.roles.length > 0) {
  newUserProps.user_role = userInfo.roles[0].displayName
}

// After — single guard
const newUserProps: GA4CustomUserProps = {}
if (userInfo.roles && userInfo.roles.length > 0) {
  setCurrentUserRole(userInfo.roles[0].authority)
  newUserProps.user_role = userInfo.roles[0].displayName
}
```

